{"text":"大魏神龜二年六月三日，前武衛將軍、夏州大中正、使持節、都督汾州諸軍事、平北將軍、汾州刺史赫連儒，仰爲七世父母恩□、妻息居□□小，敬造彌□像一區。□□亡父母□□沉形昇彼淨境。願願從心。","tags":[{"name":"Office","term":"前武衛將軍","refId":null,"text":"前武衛將軍","start":11,"end":16},{"name":"Office","term":"州大中正","refId":null,"text":"州大中正","start":18,"end":22},{"name":"Office","term":"使持節","refId":null,"text":"使持節","start":23,"end":26},{"name":"LocName","term":"汾州","refId":"hvd_113312","text":"汾州","start":29,"end":31},{"name":"Office","term":"平北將軍","refId":null,"text":"平北將軍","start":35,"end":39},{"name":"LocName","term":"汾州","refId":"hvd_113312","text":"汾州","start":40,"end":42},{"name":"PersonName","term":"赫連儒","refId":null,"text":"赫連儒","start":44,"end":47},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"淨佛國土","refId":null,"text":"淨境","start":83,"end":85}]}